These reviews are from the most recent batch available. For your planned stay (Nov 25-30, 2024), the airport proximity and shuttle seem like reliable perks, especially if you're flying in/out. If noise is a concern, you might request a room away from main units or confirm AC settings at check-in. If you'd like more reviews, details on specific room types, or help booking/searching availability, let me know!

